Camera level 1 (negronicam=1, default off): GCC camera clocks, camcc titan top GDSC, camcc AHB/CAMNOC/CCI0
clocks from the 19.2 MHz TCXO and a CCI0 reset; proof = CCI hw version + reset-done ack; then all off.
New bsd/dev/negroni_cam.c (own thread). Details: patches/xnu/README-camera.md, docs/camera-plan.md.

